<b>PEGGLE™ DELUXE</b>
<br>Version 1.0
<br>Release Date: February 27, 2007</p>
<p>Developed and published by PopCap Games, Inc.<br><a href="http://www.popcap.com" target="_new">www.popcap.com</a>
</a></p>
<p>Thanks for downloading Peggle Deluxe. We hope you enjoy the game!</p>

