Your credit card info is sent over a SSL-encrypted connection to our servers. When it's verified, we unlock the game on your computer. If you need to re-install or install on another computer, you simply reconnect to verify your purchase info... so there's no risk of ever losing your game.

We guarantee a refund if you are the victim of fraud or computer error, or within 30 days if you are dissatisfied with your purchase. We use proprietary PopCap technology and a Verisign-approved site to assure that your purchase is efficient and secure!

